{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1401666-first-vtmv-clanbook","id":1401666,"title":"First VTMV Clanbook","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-08T05:59:34-07:00","id":1401666,"title":"First VTMV Clanbook","content":"So what do you think will the first clanbook going to be and why?<br /> I think it will gonna be about Tremere because Blood Sorcery still need expanding and because the made out of one clan 4 and so there is a dire need of explaining how those 4 houses are working on the inside and how the interaction is going to be. There is a need for describing where each house has its domains and how those look like. A description about Vienna and how they each other interact with mortals is needed too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T06:29:31-07:00","id":1401670,"title":"","content":"From everything I've heard I'm pretty sure there's not going to be any new clanbooks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2198-malkavian87"